<title>USA: CNS Bancorp to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>CNS Bancorp to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, Mo. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNS Bancorp Inc said Thursday it will seek to repurchase 66,125 shares, or about four percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The shares will be used to fund the company's management recognition and development plan, which was approved by shareholders in April, the company said.</p>
<p>The shares are in addition to the 82,656-share repurchase plan announced April 8, the company said.</p>
<p>CNS shares rose 3/8 to 16 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
